trengths:</strong> <div class=3D"note-content-value markdown-rendered"><h3>=
Clear Motivation</h3>
<p>The paper leverages the structured properties of Scene Graphs to mitigat=
e the challenges associated with long videos=E2=80=94specifically, the spar=
sity of key clues and the difficulty of performing long-range spatio-tempor=
al reasoning=E2=80=94representing a well-chosen entry point.</p>
<h3>Comprehensive Framework Design</h3>
<p>The bottom-up, three-level Scene Graph construction logic is clearly art=
iculated, and the designed "Propose-Verify-Answer" toolchain is intuitive.<=
/p>
<h3>Insightful Analysis</h3>
<p>Through ablation studies and trajectory analysis, the paper demonstrates=
 how graph retrieval assists the agent in narrowing down the search space; =
the accompanying case studies are highly illustrative.</p>
